cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "flutter-rebuild-direction: Measurement Harness and Analysis for the Direction of Flutter Widget Rebuild Cost"
abstract: >-
  Measurement harness and analysis code. It builds the corpus, runs the on-device
  measurements on a Redmi 9T, and holds the four notebooks that recompute every reported
  figure. The data is in flutter-rebuild-direction-data; the extractor and profiler are the
  spm package.
